    "title": "Salivary Gland Ultrasound: Parotid, Submandibular, and Pathology",
    "date": "2026-09-25",
    "excerpt": "How to evaluate the major salivary glands on ultrasound — normal anatomy, sialadenitis, calculi, pleomorphic adenoma, Warthin's tumor, and when to recommend further imaging.",
    "author": "SonoBuddy Team",
